    "appetite": "Three thin jobs on one shared layer; each useful alone; no streaming, chat, or accounts.",
    "problem": "Hand drawing a yard and hand designing it is the blank-canvas work the product must avoid.",
    "recommended_shape": "Shared server AI layer with small zod schemas and saved runs; image import from overhead screenshot plus one size; recommendations as edit ops with ghost overlay; transition plan as code diff plus AI phasing.",
    "success_moves": [
      "Edit ops instead of whole properties, mapped to existing editor operations.",
      "Saved runs double as a fake (AI_FAKE=1) so UI work needs no live calls.",
      "Closed task list from code; AI may only order and explain task ids within allowed months.",
      "Pixel coordinates from the model, converted to feet by code from one known size.",
      "Small AI-only schemas with plant ids as an enum; propertySchema validation after mapping."
    ],
